ok 1 - PUBLIC holds no privilege on the database (no CONNECT, no TEMPORARY)
ok 2 - PUBLIC cannot create objects in schema public
ok 3 - PUBLIC has no privilege on schema lx
ok 4 - PUBLIC can execute no lx function
